# MetaHuman assets under THRESHOLD — re-downloadable from Quixel Bridge /
# MetaHuman Creator. Individual .uasset files here routinely exceed GitHub's
# 100 MB per-file cap and would consume LFS quota with no versioning benefit
# (binary, not diffable). Keep a zipped backup on external storage.
Content/THRESHOLD/MetaHuman/


# ThirdParty binaries (download locally, don't commit)
ThirdParty/whisper.cpp/lib/*.dll
ThirdParty/whisper.cpp/lib/*.lib
ThirdParty/whisper.cpp/lib/*.a
ThirdParty/OpenCV/lib/*.dll
ThirdParty/OpenCV/lib/*.lib
ThirdParty/OpenCV/lib/*.a
